            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2024-i:grammar-fill:4",
            "text": "The Glasshouse stands as a great achievement in contemporary design, to house the plants of the southwestern part of China at the end of a path retracing（追溯）the steps along the Silk Route that/which brought the plants from their native habitat in Asia to come to define much of the richness of gardening in England."
          }
        ],
